class Solution { private lateinit var words:Array<String>;private lateinit var result:String;private val mapping=IntArray(26){-1};private val used=BooleanArray(10);private val leading=BooleanArray(26);fun isSolvable(words:Array<String>,result:String):Boolean{this.words=words;this.result=result;java.util.Arrays.fill(mapping,-1);java.util.Arrays.fill(used,false);java.util.Arrays.fill(leading,false);for(word in words){if(word.length>result.length)return false;if(word.length>1)leading[word[0]-'A']=true};if(result.length>1)leading[result[0]-'A']=true;return dfs(0,0,0)};private fun dfs(column:Int,row:Int,sum:Int):Boolean{if(column==result.length)return sum==0;if(row<words.size){val word=words[row];val index=word.length-1-column;if(index<0)return dfs(column,row+1,sum);val letter=word[index]-'A';if(mapping[letter]>=0)return dfs(column,row+1,sum+mapping[letter]);for(digit in 0..9)if(!used[digit]&&(digit!=0||!leading[letter])){mapping[letter]=digit;used[digit]=true;if(dfs(column,row+1,sum+digit))return true;used[digit]=false;mapping[letter]=-1};return false};val letter=result[result.length-1-column]-'A';val digit=sum%10;val carry=sum/10;if(mapping[letter]>=0)return mapping[letter]==digit&&dfs(column+1,0,carry);if(used[digit]||digit==0&&leading[letter])return false;mapping[letter]=digit;used[digit]=true;val solved=dfs(column+1,0,carry);used[digit]=false;mapping[letter]=-1;return solved} }
